---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="From decision to workflow" description="A transparent, optional handoff from the free SEO Fan-out result into a broader Contextter SEO workflow." canonicalPath="/workflow/" pageClass="reference-page">
  <header class="reference-hero workflow-hero">
    <p class="mono-label">Optional next workflow · same operator</p>
    <h1>From a page decision to an SEO workflow.</h1>
    <p>The free result is complete before Contextter appears. If you continue, the current handoff is manual and reviewable—there is no automatic sync or account import.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="workflow-steps" aria-label="Manual workflow">
    <article><span>01</span><div><h2>Export the decision</h2><p>Download the local JSON from the Fan-out Explorer. It contains the declared inputs, modeled map, evidence gaps, and one bounded page decision.</p></div></article>
    <article><span>02</span><div><h2>Review it beside real inventory</h2><p>Use the export as a planning reference next to the keyword database, current page inventory, Google Search Console context, and Site Audit evidence in your existing workflow.</p></div></article>
    <article><span>03</span><div><h2>Turn evidence into an owned action</h2><p>Only after the recommendation survives review should it become a tracked action: extend a page, add a section, merge content, create one URL, gather evidence, or record no action.</p></div></article>
  </section>

  <section class="relationship-disclosure" aria-labelledby="relationship-title">
    <div><p class="mono-label">Commercial relationship</p><h2 id="relationship-title">Contextter is the next workspace, not an independent validator.</h2></div>
    <div><p>SEO Fan-out and Contextter share the same operator. This site does not use Contextter ownership as proof that the framework works. No Contextter account is required for the tool, decision record, stress test, copy action, or JSON export.</p><p>The current handoff is intentionally manual. An automatic import or sync must not be claimed until it exists and is verified.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="reference-section action-band">
    <div><p class="mono-label">Choose the next step</p><h2>Keep the decision local, or continue in the shared workflow.</h2></div>
    <div class="workflow-actions"><a class="button-link" href="/tool/#explorer">Run the free tool</a><a class="button-link secondary-link" href="https://contextter.com/">Open Contextter · same operator</a></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
